SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- HS Rise Bake Shop (31F) C/D Pace-- RSVP required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rot
 ating start location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- 
 mile routes\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” s
 top for refreshment/coffee mid-route at [Rise Bake Shoppe](https://www.ris
 ebakeshoppe.com/)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not have a si
 ngle pace.\nAs Sweep\, Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclist.\nThe
  CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected to stay 
 in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A planned
  stop to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other cyclist
 s to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the last g
 roup.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Ride with 
 GPS](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/hs-rise-bake-shop-31f/)\n\nH
 elmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a basic repair k
 it (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passing
  around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meetup
  RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not mean you are a 
 club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the c
 lub's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?
 page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the Road](https:
 //lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&modu
 le_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/docs.ashx
 ?id=454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader Guide](https:/
 /s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_Leader_Guide_
 2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expires=1778249903&
 response-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Leader_Guide_2026
 .pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3146941
 60/
