SUMMARY:Impromptu: HS Suze Special (17F) Hempfield Rec Center
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nHybrid ride at 11-12-13 M
 PH.\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSweep: volunteer to sweep\n\nAnticipated 
 Average Pace: 11-12-13 mph\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net
 /cue/hs-suze-special-17f/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/hs-suz
 e-special-17f/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertised average spe
 ed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main go
 al. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with o
 ccasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. Pl
 ease do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. 
 If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encoura
 ged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12-13 mph average is be
 yond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride fi
 rst.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic 
 repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate
  passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership an
 d Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you a
 re a club member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RSV
 P is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduc
 t Guidance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3151454
